# The published lib/ never requires eslint. Both shipped files import it as
# 'import type', which TypeScript erases; only the tests use the real module and
# they ship in neither the build nor the tarball.

$ tar xzOf eslint-plugin-safe-jsx-1.3.1.tgz package/lib/index.js package/lib/rules/*.js | grep require
  const { name, version } = require("../package.json");
  "jsx-explicit-boolean": require("./rules/jsx-explicit-boolean"),

=========== 1. a consumer that depends on the plugin and nothing else ===========

  eslint-plugin-safe-jsx@1.3.1, as published        71 packages
    eslint          : eslint@10.8.0
    brace-expansion : brace-expansion@5.0.8
    pnpm audit      : No known vulnerabilities found
  ...with the peer marked optional                   1 package
    eslint          : NOT INSTALLED
    brace-expansion : NOT INSTALLED

  Alone, the peer range tops out at eslint 10, whose tree carries the patched
  brace-expansion 5. So 70 packages of dead weight here, and no advisory.

=========== 2. through magic-oxlint-config, where GHSA-mh99-v99m-4gvg lands ===========

  eslint-plugin-react-native@5.0.0 peers eslint '^3.17.0 || ... || ^9'. Intersected
  with this plugin's range that pins resolution to eslint 9, and eslint 9 still
  depends on minimatch@^3.1.2 -> brace-expansion@^1.1.7.

  magic-oxlint-config@1.2.0, as published            91 packages
    eslint          : eslint@9.39.5
    brace-expansion : brace-expansion@1.1.16
    pnpm audit      : 1 vulnerabilities found

      brace-expansion@1.1.16
      └─┬ minimatch@3.1.5
        ├─┬ @eslint/config-array@0.21.2
        │ └─┬ eslint@9.39.5
        │   ├─┬ @eslint-community/eslint-utils@4.10.1
        │   │ └── eslint@9.39.5 [circular]
        │   ├─┬ eslint-plugin-react-native@5.0.0
        │   │ └─┬ magic-oxlint-config@1.2.0
        │   │   └── chain-before@1.0.0 (dependencies)
        │   └─┬ eslint-plugin-safe-jsx@1.3.1
        │     └── magic-oxlint-config@1.2.0 [deduped]
        ├─┬ @eslint/eslintrc@3.3.6

  ...with only this plugin's peer optional           91 packages
